pen Summer album\", \"bin the sixth\", \"scratch that, put it back\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w15-0054\", \"v\": [[\"I finally got round to replying to Digby earlier, just a quick catch-up, so I messaged him today. Could you log that so I've got a record of it?\", \"Oh sorry, I should've said, there are two of them. It was Vrasfeby, Digby Vrasfeby, the one I meant.\"], [\"Would you mind logging that I messaged Digby today, please?\", \"It was Digby Vrasfeby, thank you.\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w15-0055\", \"v\": [[\"messaged Digby Vrasfeby today, log it\"], [\"hey i messaged Digby Vrasfeby today, can u log that pls\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w16-0056\", \"v\": [[\"I've let my boat to-do list get out of hand and want it tidy, so could you pull up the dinghy tasks, mark the first one done and get rid of the second?\"], [\"dinghy tasks: tick 1st, delete 2nd\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w15-0057\", \"v\": [[\"what pics do i have from Wyvgeholm Hollow\", \"anything in my expenses on it?\", \"hang on, show me the Wyvgeholm trip expenses over ninety\", \"ok back to the photo, what group is it in\"], [\"Could you show me which photos I have from Wyvgeholm Hollow, please?\", \"Would you check what my expenses have on it?\", \"Sorry, hang on a moment. Could you show me the Wyvgeholm trip expenses above ninety?\", \"Going back to that photo, could you tell me which group it's in, please?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w15-0058\", \"v\": [[\"We're trying to get a handle on the shared house costs before we settle up, so could you tell me how much has been spent in the number 44 flat group so far?\"], [\"umm how much have we… how much's been spent in the number 44 flat group?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w15-0059\", \"v\": [[\"Could you tell me what's still left to do about the attic, please?\", \"The recycle one is done now, thank you.\", \"Would you check whether it's in my pictures as well, please?\"], [\"uh what've I still got to do for the, um, the attic?\", \"ok so the recycle one, yeah that's done\", \"hmm is it… is it in my pictures as well?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w16-0001\", \"v\": [[\"I'm clearing out old trip clutter I don't need anymore, so could you delete the mallaig food note for me?\", \"Oh, and while I'm sorting the money side of things, what do the plover expenses add up to?\"], [\"delete the mallaig food note pls\", \"also what do the plover expenses add up to\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w16-0002\", \"v\": [[\"Could you delete the ask note, please?\", \"On a separate matter, could you show me the pictures I took in May?\", \"About the Mahsa one, would you tell me where it was taken?\", \"Something different: could you pull up the soapmaking meetup membership entry, please?\", \"Also, could you tell me when the mistletoe viewing is?\", \"And what else is on that day, please?\"], [\"I've been decluttering and it's not useful anymore, so can you go ahead and delete the ask note?\", \"Totally different thing, I was trying to remember what I got up to in spring, what pictures did I take in May?\", \"Oh, the Mahsa one, I honestly can't place it, where was that taken?\", \"Right, switching topics, I need the details for something I signed up to, can you find the soapmaking meetup membership entry?\", \"And I've completely lost track of it, when is the mistletoe viewing again?\", \"Ok and I'm trying to plan around it, so what else have I got on that day?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w16-0003\", \"v\": [[\"I'm putting together a little summer recap and want to see what I've got, so what pictures did I take in July?\", \"Totally different thing, I can't remember when it's happening, when's the piano?\", \"And I'd like to know before it starts, who else is going to be there?\", \"I might need to get in touch beforehand, so could you give me their contact details?\", \"Oh and one more thing while I'm on paperwork, can you mark the gable report with a star so I find it easily?\"], [\"umm what pictures did I… what did I take in July?\", \"ok and uh when's the piano?\", \"who else is gonna, um, be there?\", \"can I get their… their contact details?\", \"oh and um star the gable report paperwork, yeah mark it with a star\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w16-0004\", \"v\": [[\"book call with the bank saturday at half four\", \"what's gone into tweed kitty\", \"what'd the plover come to\"], [\"can u book in a call with the bank saturday at half four\", \"whats gone into tweed kitty so far\", \"and what did the plover come to\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w16-0006\", \"v\": [[\"latest journal entry\"], [\"I want to reread what I last wrote because it's been on my mind a bit, so could you pull up my most recent journal entry?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w16-0007\", \"v\": [[\"when's my cinnamon thing\", \"diff thing, whats gone into billiards share\", \"hang on who still has to pay me back\", \"ok back to those, what's that come to altogether\"], [\"Could you tell me when my cinnamon thing is, please?\", \"On another matter, could you show me what's gone into billiards share?\", \"Sorry, hang on a moment. Who still has to pay me back?\", \"Going back to those expenses, could you tell me what they come to altogether?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w16-0008\", \"v\": [[\"I keep seeing cinnamon pop up everywhere and I've lost track of it all, so what cinnamon things do I actually have?\", \"Oh, the sunrise one, I'd love to find it again later, which album is it in?\", \"Nice, I haven't looked through that in ages, can you show me the photos in it?\", \"That's a lot to scroll through, so could you narrow it down to just anything about kitesurfing?\", \"Different thing, I'm sure I lent some money out recently and forgot, does anyone owe me cash?\"], [\"Could you tell me what cinnamon things I have, please?\", \"About the sunrise one, would you tell me which album it's in?\", \"Could you show me the photos in it, please?\", \"Would you narrow that down to anything about kitesurfing?\", \"On another subject, could you tell me whether anyone owes me cash?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w16-0009\", \"v\": [[\"Could you tell me what debts there are between me and Vaimir Paimere, please?\", \"And how much is it, please?\", \"Also, would you check whether the things note is in the trash?\"], [\"any debts between me and Vaimir Paimere\", \"how much\", \"oh and is the things note in the trash\"]]}","ttft_ms":22479,"type":"result","duration_ms":41953,"uuid":"f845806a-ab27-44cf-ae3b-6502d85b9e24","ttft_stream_ms":1408,"time_to_request_ms":150,"first_content_frame_ms":1408,"time_to_request_from_spawn_ms":22737826,"warm_spare_claimed":false,"time_origin_ms":1790279288132.364,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
